# Opt-in formatting.
#
# By default nothing is formatted by Prettier. Each app/package must opt in
# by un-ignoring itself below. apps/api is intentionally left out — it is
# Python and formatted by Black, not Prettier.

# Ignore everything at the root (anchored, so it only matches top-level
# entries and we can re-include specific subtrees below).
/*

# Opt-in: frontend apps
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/web
!/apps/mobile

# Opt-in: shared TypeScript packages
!/packages
/packages/*
!/packages/api-client
!/packages/shared

# Always ignore generated / vendored files inside the opt-in subtrees.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.lock
**/generated.ts
